htness, and a cyan-accented ColorScheme.\n\n2. Component dimensions and styling\n\n1A\n\nTop AppBar\n\nOverall 360 × 56dp. Horizontal content padding 16dp. Sparkle icon 28dp, icon-to-title gap 12dp. Title 20sp, weight 600, line height 24sp. PRO 4K pill height 28dp, radius 14dp, horizontal padding 12dp, amber-to-violet linear gradient. No BackdropFilter on the AppBar itself.\n\n1B\n\nDevice Resolution Banner\n\n360 × 64dp, padding 16dp, radius 16dp, BackdropFilter sigma 20. Glass background #101626CC, border 1dp #FFFFFF1A. Checkmark circle 40dp; chevron 20dp. Main text 15sp/20sp weight 600; secondary text 12sp/16sp weight 400. Render as two lines: QHD+ 1440×3200 and Auto-Matched • 120Hz Ready.\n\n1C\n\nSearch Bar + Filter Button\n\nContainer 360 × 56dp. Search field width 292dp, filter button 56dp, gap 12dp. Both radius 16dp, glass blur sigma 20, border 1dp #FFFFFF1A. TextField horizontal padding 16dp, search icon 24dp, hint 14sp/20sp #94A3B8. Filter icon 24dp #00F5D4.\n\n1D\n\nCategory Filter Chips\n\nHeight 36dp, horizontal padding 16dp, vertical padding 8dp, radius 18dp, minimum width 64dp, gap 8dp. Active background #00F5D4 and text #070A12; inactive background #101626CC, text #E2E8F0, border #FFFFFF1A. Typography 14sp/20sp, weight 500. Horizontally scrollable row.\n\n1E\n\n4K Wallpaper Grid Card\n\nAspect ratio 9/16; showcase size 288 × 512dp. Actual 2-column grid size at the reference viewport: 174 × 309.3dp. Card radius 16dp, BoxFit.cover, overlay padding 10–12dp. 4K AI badge height 24dp, radius 12dp, text 12sp weight 700. Favorite button 32 × 32dp, circular, blur sigma 16. Bottom metadata glass overlay height 56dp for grid cards or 72dp for showcase cards, blur sigma 20. Title 14sp weight 600; resolution 11sp weight 500.\n\n1F\n\n5-Tab Bottom Navigation\n\n360 × 72dp plus bottom system-safe-area padding. Radius 24dp, glass background #101626CC, blur sigma 20, border 1dp #FFFFFF1A. Internal padding horizontal 8dp, vertical 6dp. Five equally expanded tabs, icon