   │           │                   └── GlassMetadataOverlay\n    │           └── SliverToBoxAdapter(bottom spacing)\n    └── bottomNavigationBar\n        └── SafeArea\n            └── 1F AuraBottomNavigation\n                └── ClipRRect\n                    └── BackdropFilter\n                        └── DecoratedBox\n                            └── Row\n                                └── Expanded(NavTab) × 5\n\n4. Recommended layout constraints\n\nAt the reference screen width, use the following relationships rather than hardcoding every horizontal dimension.\n\ndart\n\nconst double screenPadding = 16;\nconst double gridGap = 12;\nconst double itemAspectRatio = 9 / 16;\n\nfinal double contentWidth =\n    MediaQuery.sizeOf(context).width - screenPadding * 2;\n\nfinal double searchWidth = contentWidth - 56 - 12;\n\nfinal double wallpaperCardWidth =\n    (contentWidth - gridGap) / 2;\n\nfinal double wallpaperCardHeight =\n    wallpaperCardWidth / itemAspectRatio;\n\n\nFor consistent glassmorphism across the six components, use this shared wrapper pattern:\n\ndart\n\nimport 'dart:ui';\nimport 'package:flutter/material.dart';\n\nclass AuraGlass extends StatelessWidget {\n  const AuraGlass({\n    super.key,\n    required this.child,\n    this.radius = 16,\n    this.sigma = 20,\n  });\n\n  final Widget child;\n  final double radius;\n  final double sigma;\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return ClipRRect(\n      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(radius),\n      child: BackdropFilter(\n        filter: ImageFilter.blur(\n          sigmaX: sigma,\n          sigmaY: sigma,\n        ),\n        child: DecoratedBox(\n          decoration: BoxDecoration(\n            color: const Color(0xCC101626),\n            borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(radius),\n            border: Border.all(\n              color: const Color(0x1AFFFFFF),\n              width: 1,\n            ),\n          ),\n          child: child,\n        ),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n5. Important development details\n\nGrid scrolling: The wallpaper card uses a true 9:16 aspect ratio, so the two-row catalog will extend beyond one short mobile viewport. Keep the bottom navigation pinned and let the catalog scroll.\n\nCategory behavior: Use a horizontal scroll container; do not compress all six labels into the available 360dp width.\n\nWallpaper image handling: Use artwork as separate 9:16 assets. The generated component sheet is a visual reference, not a collection of independent transparent sprites.\n\nFavorites: Keep favorite state outside the visual widget, keyed by wallpaper ID.\n\nAuto-Match: Populate actual resolution and refresh rate from device capability detection rather than hardcoding the sample 1440×3200 and 120Hz values.\n\nGlass performance: Clip each blur region, avoid applying fullscreen blur behind the entire wallpaper grid, and reduce sigma if needed on lower-end devices.\n\nDeliverable: One labeled component-sheet PNG plus implementation specifications for 1A–1F, using the established AuraWall AI dark theme and responsive Flutter layout.\n\nChatGPT có thể mắc lỗi. Hãy kiểm tra thông tin quan trọng.\nPhản hồi mới nhất\n\n\n\n\nCao"